	(footprint "Heatsinks:TO-220-3_Vertical_HS657-10ABPE"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "1db4b88a-d95a-4f4e-85db-eb8451a04cbd")
		(at 122.333333 69.84 -90)
		(descr "TO-220-3 vertical transistor (RM 2.54mm, IRL540N/IRF9540N) bolted to a Wakefield 657-10ABPE vertical board-mount heat sink (same 657 extrusion/pin pattern as the TO-264 variant in this library). Combined footprint (origin = device pin 1): pads 1/2/3 = device G/D/S (drill 1.1mm); two unnamed plated pads = heat-sink wave-solder pins (0.093in/2.4mm dia on 1.000in/25.4mm centres, symmetric about the device centre). Heat-sink base 41.9 x 25.4mm. Device bolts to the sink central web through its TO-220 tab hole - use Boyd 4880G insulator+shoulder-washer kit plus #4-40 screw/washers/nut (tab is NOT at heatsink potential). Thermal 6.8 C/W natural, 3.7 C/W @ 200 LFM. VERIFY heat-sink pin-row depth (Y offset) and web hole height vs the physical 657-10ABPE + TO-220 stack before fabrication. CH card worst case ~10W/device at 2.5A TEC cooling - see manual sec 11.")
